1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,467
[HUMMING]

2
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:10,367
[HUMMING CONTINUES]

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,300
You don't have to do that.
We've got staff for it.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,200
Come on.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,233
Consider it one of my freebies
for you.

6
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:20,633
What's that?

7
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:23,500
I was going to send it
to the laundry.

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,667
The laundry? I'll do it!

9
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:26,267
- Give it to me!
- No.

10
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:27,633
Come on. Don't be shy.

11
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,567
- Give it to me.
- No, it's fine.

12
00:00:29,567 --> 00:00:36,067
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:00:40,733 --> 00:00:42,067
What's this?

14
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:43,700
[CLEARS THROAT]

15
00:00:45,633 --> 00:00:46,700
A stain?

16
00:00:48,533 --> 00:00:50,433
I'll wash it for you.
Don't be shy.

17
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:52,333
This'll be easy.

18
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:56,567
You don't have to adjust
for me, okay?

19
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,167
I'm only here for the company.

20
00:00:59,533 --> 00:01:03,233
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

21
00:01:03,233 --> 00:01:04,433
For the company.

22
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:07,333
Didn't you say...

23
00:01:07,767 --> 00:01:10,300
we have to make everyone
believe...

24
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,533
that we're serious?

25
00:01:12,467 --> 00:01:13,667
So...

26
00:01:13,667 --> 00:01:15,700
I'm one hundred percent
committed.

27
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,267
Here.

28
00:01:20,233 --> 00:01:21,633
- What's this?
- Your lunch.

29
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:23,400
Go on, it's time for work.

30
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,167
Go on.

31
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:28,200
It's good. Go on.
Get to work!

32
00:01:28,633 --> 00:01:30,500
You're so fussy.

33
00:01:34,733 --> 00:01:36,667
Dear, can I ask you something?

34
00:01:36,667 --> 00:01:39,467
I've been seeing all this
stuff online about...

35
00:01:39,467 --> 00:01:41,267
DNA tests.

36
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,300
Did the attorney have you
take one?

37
00:01:43,867 --> 00:01:45,200
A DNA test?

38
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,200
Ma...

39
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,467
How could that happen?

40
00:01:48,467 --> 00:01:50,567
The Roces are already
at the bottom

41
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:51,767
of the West Philippine Sea.

42
00:01:52,633 --> 00:01:55,167
- Oh, right.
- Why'd you ask, Ma?

43
00:01:56,333 --> 00:01:57,700
Nothing.

44
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,633
It just crossed my mind.

45
00:01:59,633 --> 00:02:00,833
I'll wash this first, Ma.

46
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:02,800
- So many stains!
- Okay, go ahead.

47
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,300
Do a good job, okay?

48
00:02:06,133 --> 00:02:09,400
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

49
00:02:10,133 --> 00:02:11,233
Good morning, sir!

50
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:21,300
[JUNE]<i> Don't skip your meals
</i> at work.

51
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:24,333
<i>Take care, Papa Ping.
Love, Baby Bulol.</i>

52
00:02:25,367 --> 00:02:31,500
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

53
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,800
Your girlfriend's
so sweet, boss.

54
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:36,267
It's been a while since
I've seen you smile like that.

55
00:02:36,567 --> 00:02:38,233
[ENGINE STARTING]

56
00:02:42,267 --> 00:02:43,467
Must be nice!

57
00:02:43,467 --> 00:02:47,267
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]
